WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:07.600
SCP-343 Vs SCP-076. The anomaly that claims&nbsp;
to be God vs God’s favorite grandson,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.640
Able. What would happen if&nbsp;
the two ever went toe to toe?

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:16.320
In terms of raw combat prowess, SCP-076&nbsp;
would undeniably be the stronger option.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.960
He’s one of the deadliest&nbsp;
humanoid combatants ever known,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:23.200
and his ability to produce deadly blades&nbsp;
from thin air makes him equally resourceful.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:29.120
SCP-343, while not a standard combatant, does&nbsp;
have immensely powerful reality warping abilities.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:33.200
It’s possible that his non-standard fighting&nbsp;
methods would allow him to get the jump on Able,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.960
whose skill is also rather conventional,&nbsp;
clinching him the last-minute win.&nbsp;

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:40.800
After all, in a fight against God, God often wins.

